==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This armor class (AC) bonus is called "natural", but it is classified as "[[armor class#Other sources of AC|other]]", so it [[stack]]s with all sources of AC.

=== PnP comparison ===

* The [[pencil-and-paper]] version of this feat could be taken multiple times, but the ''Neverwinter Nights'' version can be taken only once. Also it gave a +1 bonus instead to natural armor.